<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>By Your nature is mine sanctified,</l><l>And my beauty’s from Your life divine.</l><l>I’m renewed, submissive, sweet,</l><l>With Thee, with hind’s feet leap.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>As a dove, You alone do I see;</l><l>As a lily, I’m trusting in Thee.</l><l>I’m transformed and built by Thee</l><l>Your rest and joy to be.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
